: "925年向延嗣至蜀后", "dynasty": "五代十国", "description": "李从袭向向延嗣指郭专权、郭廷诲结交军将土豪并求蜀帅。", "phases": [], "location_name": "成都", "location_modern_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_note": "仅保留史载地名；未核坐标。", "status": "draft", "id": "1bf8f61e-2ff5-53b9-acb7-182a7d88ba10"}, {"title": "李从袭续称诸将皆郭党、魏王身险，并与向延嗣相向垂泪", "start_year": 925, "end_year": 925, "time_original": "925年向延嗣至蜀时", "dynasty": "五代十国", "description": "李从袭续称诸将皆郭党、魏王身险，并与向延嗣相向垂泪。", "phases": [], "location_name": "成都", "location_modern_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_note": "仅保留史载地名；未核坐标。", "status": "draft", "id": "66038985-9818-5129-8063-eef93587f1c7"}, {"title": "向延嗣回报刘后，刘后泣诉求救继岌，李存勖因先后报告疑郭", "start_year": 925, "end_year": 925, "time_original": "925年向延嗣还朝后", "dynasty": "五代十国", "description": "向延嗣回报刘后，刘后泣诉求救继岌，李存勖因先后报告疑郭。", "phases": [], "location_name": "后唐朝廷", "location_modern_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_note": "仅保留史载地名；未核坐标。", "status": "draft", "id": "1a52cd82-f880-5d61-bd98-bf076081d9eb"}, {"title": "李存勖阅蜀府库簿，质问所获珍货为何少", "start_year": 925, "end_year": 925, "time_original": "925年向延嗣回报后", "dynasty": "五代十国", "description": "李存勖阅蜀府库簿，质问所获珍货为何少。", "phases": [], "location_name": "后唐朝廷", "location_modern_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_note": "仅保留史载地名；未核坐标。", "status": "draft", "id": "0b72de37-fba4-5f67-8eb6-0d7d8e740f21"}, {"title": "向延嗣声称郭父子收蜀珍货，报郭金银钱马数量，李存勖发怒", "start_year": 925, "end_year": 925, "time_original": "925年阅蜀簿时", "dynasty": "五代十国", "description": "向延嗣声称郭父子收蜀珍货，报郭金银钱马数量，李存勖发怒。", "phases": [], "location_name": "后唐朝廷", "location_modern_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_note": "仅保留史载地名；未核坐标。", "status": "draft", "id": "c82a9821-b88c-54d3-820b-2b6525d7d5b6"}, {"title": "李存勖嘱孟知祥到蜀诛郭